nodes.statement:
For a set of vertices $S$ and every $k\in[s, n - s - 1]$ we have
  \begin{flalign*}
     \text{(i)}&& \frac{1-Y_{k-1}^{S}}{k(n-k) + 1}  &\leq  \mathbb{E}[X_k^{S} \mid \mathcal A_{k-1}^{S}]  \leq  \frac{1}{k(n-k)(1-\delta_k) + 1};&
     \\ \text{(ii)}&&  \left( 1 - \frac{1}{(\log n)^{s^{1/3}}} \right) \cdot \frac{1-Y_{k-1}^{S}}{k(n-k) + 1}
     &\leq \mathbb{E}[\hstretch{2}{\hat{\hstretch{.5}{X}}}_k^{S} \mid \mathcal A_{k-1}^{S}]
     \leq \frac{1}{k(n-k)(1-\delta_k) + 1}.
  \end{flalign*}

For a set of nodes $S$ of cardinality $s\ge (\log n)^b$ with $b\ge 3$, with probability at least $1-n^{-\log n /4}$, for every $k\in [s, n-s-1]$, it holds that
  \begin{flalign*}
    \text{(i)} &&   \left( 1 - \frac{\log{n}}{\sqrt{n}} \right) \cdot \frac{1}{k(n-k) + 1}  &\leq  \mathbb{E}[X_k^{S} \mid \mathcal A_{k-1}^{S}]  \leq  \frac{1}{k(n-k)(1-\delta_k) + 1};&
    \\ \text{(ii)}  && \left( 1 - \frac{2\log n}{\sqrt{n}} \right) \cdot \frac{1}{k(n-k) + 1}  &\leq  \mathbb{E}[\hstretch{2}{\hat{\hstretch{.5}{X}}}_k^{S} \mid \mathcal A_{k-1}^{S}]  \leq  \frac{1}{k(n-k)(1-\delta_k) + 1}.
  \end{flalign*}

For $k \in[s, n - 1]$, it holds that
  \begin{align*}
    &\frac{\log k - \log  s + \log (n -  s + 1) - \log(n - k)}{n} - \frac{3}{n}
    \\&\qquad \leq \sum_{i= s}^k \frac{1}{i(n-i) + 1} \leq \sum_{i= s}^k \frac{1}{i(n-i)}
    \\&\qquad \qquad\leq \frac{\log k - \log  s + \log (n -  s + 1) - \log(n - k)}{n} + \frac{3}{n}.
  \end{align*}
